        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "kernel.decide",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "kernel.step",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " do not. Jev is usable now through early access. The OpenAI Decisions API is a public beta that waits on the next Pi release and an "
